  "paper_id": "asplos-2024-flame-a-centralized-cache-controller-for-serverless-comp-8dcb4378",
  "title": "Flame: A Centralized Cache Controller for Serverless Computing",
  "abstract": "Caching function is a promising way to mitigate coldstart overhead in serverless computing. However, as caching also increases the resource cost significantly, how to make caching decisions is still challenging. We find that the prior \"local cache control\" designs are insufficient to achieve high cache efficiency due to the workload skewness across servers.",
